OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1793260565
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMum of critically ill baby denied
OL,4,Ahospital food as she wasn't
OL,5,Abreastfeeding
OL,6,
OL,7,FDespite giving birth in the hospital
OL,8,Ffive days earlier, she was told she was
OL,9,Fno longer classed as a patient as she
OL,10,Fwas not breastfeeding, so she would not
OL,11,Fbe provided with meals.
OL,13,FAneurin Bevan health board said it was
OL,14,F"sorry to hear about Sophie's
OL,15,Fexperience" and was "committed to
OL,16,Fsupporting families throughout their
OL,17,Fchild's stay".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
